<?xml version="1.0" ?>
<AUTOSAR xmlns="http://autosar.org/schema/r4.0" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="http://autosar.org/schema/r4.0 AUTOSAR_00046.xsd">
  <ADMIN-DATA>
    <DOC-REVISIONS>
      <DOC-REVISION>
        <REVISION-LABEL>4.4.0</REVISION-LABEL>
        <ISSUED-BY>AUTOSAR</ISSUED-BY>
      </DOC-REVISION>
    </DOC-REVISIONS>
  </ADMIN-DATA>
  <AR-PACKAGES>
    <AR-PACKAGE UUID="ECUC:AUTOSAR">
      <SHORT-NAME>AUTOSAR</SHORT-NAME>
      <AR-PACKAGES>
        <AR-PACKAGE UUID="ECUC:ECUCDEFS">
          <SHORT-NAME>EcucDefs</SHORT-NAME>
          <ELEMENTS>
            <ECUC-MODULE-DEF UUID="ECUC:37f208f2-5f1b-46d0-88ad-5a6d0ab35c0a">
              <SHORT-NAME>EthIf</SHORT-NAME>
              <DESC>
                <L-2 L="EN">Configuration of the EthIf (Ethernet Interface) module.</L-2>
                <L-2 L="ZH">概述：EthIf是以太网接口模块，它提供了AUTOSAR软件架构中的通用以太网通信接口，用于抽象底层的以太网驱动和控制器。</L-2>
                <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置EthIf模块时，需要确保它与底层的Eth驱动和硬件控制器的配置相匹配；此外，还要考虑与上层通信管理和网络管理模块的交互；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中可能引入了新的配置参数或者对现有参数的解释有所更新，需要参照最新的标准文档进行配置。</L-2>
              </DESC>
              <ADMIN-DATA>
                <DOC-REVISIONS>
                  <DOC-REVISION>
                    <REVISION-LABEL>4.4.0</REVISION-LABEL>
                    <ISSUED-BY>AUTOSAR</ISSUED-BY>
                  </DOC-REVISION>
                </DOC-REVISIONS>
              </ADMIN-DATA>
              <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_EthIf_00049</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
              <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
              <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
              <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-SUPPORT>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-SUPPORT>
              <SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANTS>
                <SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANT>
                <SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANT>
                <SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANT>
              </SUPPORTED-CONFIG-VARIANTS>
              <CONTAINERS>
                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:2e80d7a0-8c5e-4418-90e5-7566219aa6e2">
                  <SHORT-NAME>EthIfConfigSet</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="EN">Collecting container for all parameters with post-build configuration classes.</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：EthIfConfigSet 是一个配置容器，它包含了以太网接口模块（EthIf）的配置集合，用于定义网络接口层的参数，如控制器引用、缓冲区大小和过滤器设置等。</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置EthIfConfigSet时，需要确保其参数与底层以太网控制器和物理传输媒介的特性相匹配；此外，配置集合中的每个参数都应符合AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中定义的数据类型和取值范围；在多配置集环境中，还需注意配置集之间的切换逻辑和一致性。</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_EthIf_00010</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <SUB-CONTAINERS>
                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:b0742c53-b8e3-4b1f-90d5-44cf6cf0f904">
                      <SHORT-NAME>EthIfController</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration of EthIfController.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：EthIfController 配置项定义了以太网接口控制器的属性，包括其物理控制器引用和相关的配置参数。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保每个EthIfController配置项正确映射到相应的硬件控制器；在配置时需注意与网络管理功能的兼容性；配置参数应符合AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准，以保证网络通信的正确性和效率。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_EthIf_00025</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>255</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <PARAMETERS>
                        <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:11f8c68f-cb6d-48f9-b8a6-b4f8cd0aa940">
                          <SHORT-NAME>EthIfCtrlIdx</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This parameter provides a zero-based consecutive index of the Ethernet Communication Controllers. Upper layer BSW modules and the EthIf itself use this index to identify a Ethernet CC.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：EthIfCtrlIdx是用于标识以太网接口控制器的唯一索引，它关联特定的以太网控制器与上层以太网接口配置。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保每个EthIfCtrlIdx与唯一的以太网控制器相对应，避免索引重复；该索引值通常由系统自动生成，手动修改可能导致系统配置不一致；在多控制器系统中，正确的索引映射对于网络通信的正确性至关重要。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_EthIf_00026</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <MAX>255</MAX>
                          <MIN>0</MIN>
                        </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:5c7b376a-c30d-4dad-86e9-3d006d5eeeac">
                          <SHORT-NAME>EthIfCtrlMtu</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Specifies the maximum transmission unit (MTU) of the EthIfCtrl in [bytes].</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：EthIfCtrlMtu 是一个配置项，用于定义以太网接口控制器（Ethernet Interface Controller）的最大传输单元（Maximum Transmission Unit, MTU），即可以通过网络接口发送的最大数据包大小。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：MTU值必须与网络的实际能力相匹配，避免数据包过大导致分片；在配置MTU时，应考虑网络协议栈的要求和硬件能力；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保MTU值的配置与通信控制器和网络驱动的能力相一致。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">Note: In case a VLAN tag is used for the EthIfCtrl, the frame length of the Ethernet frame will increase by 4 bytes.</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_EthIf_00032</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <MAX>9000</MAX>
                          <MIN>64</MIN>
                        </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:a44750e3-3109-41f0-bee8-aa9994ce0a0a">
                          <SHORT-NAME>EthIfMaxTxBufsTotal</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Limits the total number of transmit buffers.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：EthIfMaxTxBufsTotal配置项定义了以太网接口(EthIf)模块可用于发送操作的最大传输缓冲区总数，这个参数直接影响网络通信的效率和性能。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该配置项的值需要根据网络通信量和系统资源合理设置，以避免缓冲区溢出或资源浪费；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中，确保该值与网络堆栈和硬件资源相匹配；过低的配置可能导致发送队列满，影响数据发送效率。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_EthIf_00002</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <MAX>4294967295</MAX>
                          <MIN>1</MIN>
                        </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:3f77c980-3fb1-4f5c-b6d9-36dc500a86fb">
                          <SHORT-NAME>EthIfVlanId</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">A virtual-LAN is identified by this attribute according to IEEE 802.1Q.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：EthIfVlanId 配置项用于定义以太网接口（Ethernet Interface）的虚拟局域网（VLAN）标识符，这是一个在以太网帧中用于区分不同虚拟网络的标签。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：VLAN ID的取值范围通常是0到4095，其中0和4095是保留值；在配置VLAN ID时，需要确保它在网络中是唯一的，以避免VLAN间的冲突；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，应当确保EthIfVlanId与网络配置和硬件支持相匹配。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_EthIf_00029</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <MAX>4095</MAX>
                          <MIN>0</MIN>
                        </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                        <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:3f77c980-3fb1-4f5c-b6d9-36dc500a86fb">
                          <SHORT-NAME>EthIfLinkAggrThreshold</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Threshold when a link is issued on EthIf controller level.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：EthIfLinkAggrThreshold 配置项用于定义以太网接口链路聚合中的阈值，该阈值决定何时触发链路聚合或解聚操作。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置此参数时，需确保阈值设置符合网络的带宽和流量需求；不正确的阈值可能导致网络性能下降或不稳定；此配置项在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中未明确定义，需要根据具体实现或供应商的指导进行配置。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <ADMIN-DATA>
                            <SDGS>
                              <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                <SD GID="VCOS:CfgValue">1</SD>
                              </SDG>
                            </SDGS>
                          </ADMIN-DATA>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_EthIf_00029</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <MAX>255</MAX>
                          <MIN>1</MIN>
                        </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                      </PARAMETERS>
                      <REFERENCES>
                        <ECUC-CHOICE-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:cd3ca8d1-b17b-4b15-8e42-b91f7d5bcf6c">
                          <SHORT-NAME>EthIfSwitchRefOrPortGroupRef</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">The choice reference allows to configure either the EthIfController references an EthIfSwitch or an EthIfSwitchPortGroup.</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <ADMIN-DATA>
                            <SDGS>
                              <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                <SD GID="VCOS:CfgValue"></SD>
                              </SDG>
                            </SDGS>
                          </ADMIN-DATA>
                          <INTRODUCTION>
                            <P>
                              <L-1 L="EN">Reference to a EthIfSwitchPortGroup. In case port groups are controlled by PNC EthIfSwitchPortGroupRefSemantics shall have the value ETHIF_SWITCH_PORT_GROUP_LINK_INFO. In case port groups are controlled by the EhtIfController EthIfSwitchPortGroupRefSemantics shall have the value ETHIF_SWITCH_PORT_GROUP_CONTROL.</L-1>
                            </P>
                          </INTRODUCTION>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_EthIf_00048</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                          <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
