                      </REFERENCES>
                    </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:a26859f2-c119-451c-a50c-81fd5377b064">
                      <SHORT-NAME>EthIfTransceiver</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the configuration of EthIfTransceiver.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：EthIfTransceiver配置项用于定义以太网接口传输器的属性，包括其标识符、所支持的速率以及与之关联的控制器信息等，以确保网络通信的正确配置和优化性能。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置EthIfTransceiver时，必须确保其标识符与实际硬件或虚拟接口相匹配；支持的速率应与网络需求和硬件能力相一致；正确配置关联的控制器信息，以保证网络层与物理层的有效通信。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">The usage of EthIfEthTrcvRef and EthIfWEthTrcvRefis exclusive OR.</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_EthIf_00042</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>255</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <PARAMETERS>
                        <ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:81d365c7-b414-4e29-8f0e-9638a0ac44e2">
                          <SHORT-NAME>EthIfTransceiverIdx</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">This parameter provides a zero-based consecutive index of the Ethernet transceivers. Upper layer BSW modules and the Ethernet Interface itself use this index to identify an Ethernet tranceiver.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：EthIfTransceiverIdx 是一个配置项，用于指定以太网接口控制器（Ethernet Interface Controller）与物理传输设备（Transceiver）之间的索引关系，确保数据能夠正确地在网络层和物理层之间传输。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需要确保EthIfTransceiverIdx与实际硬件连接的物理传输设备相匹配；索引值应在有效范围内，且不应与其他设备的索引冲突；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，此配置项应与其他网络配置参数一起被正确地集成和管理。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <ADMIN-DATA>
                            <SDGS>
                              <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">false</SD>
                                <SD GID="VCOS:CfgValue">0</SD>
                              </SDG>
                            </SDGS>
                          </ADMIN-DATA>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_EthIf_00043</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <MAX>255</MAX>
                          <MIN>0</MIN>
                        </ECUC-INTEGER-PARAM-DEF>
                      </PARAMETERS>
                      <REFERENCES>
                        <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:134179d8-eb26-413d-b59a-69f08f1f38d3">
                          <SHORT-NAME>EthIfEthTrcvRef</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Reference to an Ethernet transceiver, which is handled by a specific Ethernet transceiver driver.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：EthIfEthTrcvRef是一个配置项，用于指定以太网接口（EthIf）与其所连接的以太网收发器（EthTrcv）之间的关联关系，确保数据能够在物理层正确传输。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置EthIfEthTrcvRef时，必须确保引用的以太网收发器已在系统中定义且配置正确；该配置项对于实现网络层与物理层之间的通信至关重要；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保该配置项与网络管理和诊断功能的兼容性。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <ADMIN-DATA>
                            <SDGS>
                              <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                <SD GID="VCOS:CfgValue"></SD>
                              </SDG>
                            </SDGS>
                          </ADMIN-DATA>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_EthIf_00044</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/EthTrcv/EthTrcvConfigSet/EthTrcvConfig</DESTINATION-REF>
                        </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                        <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:e2c33baf-ab11-4ad0-b539-1c1271b031f7">
                          <SHORT-NAME>EthIfWEthTrcvRef</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Reference to an Wireless Ethernet transceiver, which is handled by a specific Wireless Ethernet transceiver driver.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：EthIfWEthTrcvRef配置项用于定义以太网接口模块（EthIf）与特定的以太网收发器（Transceiver）之间的关联，确保数据能够在物理层正确传输。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保每个EthIf模块正确地引用了对应的以太网收发器组件；在配置时需注意收发器的兼容性和支持的功能；对于使用多个网络接口的系统，正确的收发器引用对于网络性能和稳定性至关重要。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <ADMIN-DATA>
                            <SDGS>
                              <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                                <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                                <SD GID="VCOS:CfgValue"></SD>
                              </SDG>
                            </SDGS>
                          </ADMIN-DATA>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_EthIf_00074</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/WEthTrcv/WEthTrcvConfigSet/WEthTrcvConfig</DESTINATION-REF>
                        </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                      </REFERENCES>
                    </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                    <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:b423970d-2818-47ed-9d91-b62cbccc1f47">
                      <SHORT-NAME>EthIfTxConfirmationConfig</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Configuration of transmit indication callback functions.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：EthIfTxConfirmationConfig 是一个配置项，用于定义以太网接口模块（EthIf）在传输帧成功后是否需要调用确认回调函数（TxConfirmation）。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，需要确保该配置与网络管理和诊断通信的需求相一致；如果网络管理不需要传输确认，可能会禁用此功能以减少开销；在配置时应考虑系统的实时性和性能要求。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_EthIf_00016</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>255</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <PARAMETERS>
                        <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF UUID="ECUC:0066da3a-acae-4b4d-8d01-26abd02c73d1">
                          <SHORT-NAME>EthIfTxConfirmationFunction</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Specifies transmit indication callback function</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：EthIfTxConfirmationFunction 是用于配置以太网接口传输确认的函数，该函数在数据包成功发送后被调用，用于通知上层协议数据传输的状态。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保该函数的实现符合网络通信的实时性要求；函数应避免执行复杂或耗时的操作，以免影响网络性能；在配置时需确保与网络驱动和上层协议的兼容性。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_EthIf_00017</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF-VARIANTS>
                            <ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF-CONDITIONAL/>
                          </ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF-VARIANTS>
                        </ECUC-FUNCTION-NAME-DEF>
                      </PARAMETERS>
                      <REFERENCES>
                        <ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF UUID="ECUC:54c10002-0930-476d-8d0b-a178bf138d77">
                          <SHORT-NAME>FrameOwnerRef</SHORT-NAME>
                          <DESC>
                            <L-2 L="EN">Reference to the frame owner to assign the TxIndication function.</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">概述：FrameOwnerRef 是一个配置项，用于指定网络帧（如CAN帧、Ethernet帧等）的所有者，通常是指定哪个ECU或网络控制器负责处理该帧。</L-2>
                            <L-2 L="ZH">注意：确保FrameOwnerRef正确指向负责处理特定帧的ECU或网络控制器；不正确的配置可能导致网络通信故障；在多ECU系统中，配置必须明确区分各ECU的责任和帧所有权。</L-2>
                          </DESC>
                          <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_EthIf_00028</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                          <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <SCOPE>ECU</SCOPE>
                          <MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-MULTIPLICITY-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </MULTIPLICITY-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-MULTIPLICITY>
                          <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>true</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                          <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>LINK</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>POST-BUILD</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                            <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                              <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                            </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                          <REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>true</REQUIRES-SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                          <DESTINATION-REF DEST="ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF">/AUTOSAR/EcucDefs/EthIf/EthIfConfigSet/EthIfFrameOwnerConfig</DESTINATION-REF>
                        </ECUC-REFERENCE-DEF>
                      </REFERENCES>
                    </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                  </SUB-CONTAINERS>
                </ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF>
                <ECUC-PARAM-CONF-CONTAINER-DEF UUID="ECUC:6c8794b3-e72e-43f7-b296-4c01cf430dbc">
                  <SHORT-NAME>EthIfGeneral</SHORT-NAME>
                  <DESC>
                    <L-2 L="EN">This container contains the general configuration parameters of the Ethernet Interface.</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">概述：EthIfGeneral 是一个配置容器，包含了以太网接口模块（EthIf）的通用配置参数，例如是否启用特定功能或者定义全局参数。</L-2>
                    <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置EthIfGeneral时，需要确保所选参数与AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中定义的参数一致；此外，配置时应考虑与其他网络层组件的兼容性；最后，对于启用的功能，必须确保底层硬件和驱动支持这些功能。</L-2>
                  </DESC>
                  <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_EthIf_00001</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                  <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                  <PARAMETERS>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:0749db1b-7fdd-4e28-92c7-b583b40e921f">
                      <SHORT-NAME>EthIfDevErrorDetect</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Switches the development error detection and notification on or off.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：EthIfDevErrorDetect 是一个配置参数，用于启用或禁用以太网接口模块（EthIf）的开发错误检测功能，以便在运行时监测和报告内部错误。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在生产环境中通常禁用此功能以优化性能；开发和测试阶段建议启用以便于问题诊断；确保此配置与系统的诊断策略和性能要求相一致。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <ADMIN-DATA>
                        <SDGS>
                          <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                            <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                            <SD GID="VCOS:CfgValue">false</SD>
                          </SDG>
                        </SDGS>
                      </ADMIN-DATA>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">* true: detection and notification is enabled.
                                        * false: detection and notification is disabled.</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_EthIf_00004</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:cd0c0315-e5ac-4c42-804e-04f5a8289812">
                      <SHORT-NAME>EthIfEnableRxInterrupt</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Enables / Disables receive interrupt.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：EthIfEnableRxInterrupt 是一个配置项，用于启用或禁用以太网接口（Ethernet Interface）的接收（Rx）中断，这有助于控制网络消息的接收时机。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置此项时，需要考虑实际的硬件能力和系统的实时性要求；不恰当的启用或禁用接收中断可能会影响系统的性能和响应时间；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保与其他网络管理配置项协同工作，避免配置冲突。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <ADMIN-DATA>
                        <SDGS>
                          <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                            <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                            <SD GID="VCOS:CfgValue">true</SD>
                          </SDG>
                        </SDGS>
                      </ADMIN-DATA>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_EthIf_00005</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:d1fc9c47-8cd4-447e-a3c2-238f33d5be63">
                      <SHORT-NAME>EthIfEnableSignalQualityApi</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Enable/disable the APIs read and clear the signal quality.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：EthIfEnableSignalQualityApi 用于启用或禁用以太网接口的信号质量检测API，允许软件获取网络信号质量相关信息。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4中，默认情况下此API可能未启用，需要在系统配置中明确启用；确保硬件和底层驱动支持信号质量检测功能；使用此API可能会增加系统资源消耗，应评估性能影响。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <ADMIN-DATA>
                        <SDGS>
                          <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                            <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                          </SDG>
                        </SDGS>
                      </ADMIN-DATA>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_EthIf_00076</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
