                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:f8834dcb-ef9a-49da-a68f-954aa34117d2">
                      <SHORT-NAME>EthIfGetBaudRate</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Enables / Disables GetBaudRate API.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：EthIfGetBaudRate用于获取以太网接口的当前波特率，这是网络通信中的一个关键参数，影响数据传输速率。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保所设置的波特率与硬件和网络设计相匹配；AUTOSAR CP 4.4中并未直接定义此API，而是通过EthIf模块的配置参数间接影响；在实际应用中，需考虑网络的实际带宽和延迟要求。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <ADMIN-DATA>
                        <SDGS>
                          <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                            <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                          </SDG>
                        </SDGS>
                      </ADMIN-DATA>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_EthIf_00034</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
