                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:1e274416-517b-496a-99a9-d0a0d02c9640">
                      <SHORT-NAME>EthIfGlobalTimeSupport</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Enables/Disables the Global Time APIs used amongst others by Global Time Synchronization over Ethernet.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：EthIfGlobalTimeSupport 配置项用于指定以太网接口模块是否支持全局时间同步功能，这通常与 IEEE 802.1AS 或者其他时间同步协议的实现相关。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在配置时需确保硬件和底层驱动支持时间同步功能；如果项目不需要时间同步功能，则不应启用此配置项以避免不必要的资源消耗；AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，此配置项应与网络管理和时间同步相关的其他配置项保持一致性。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_EthIf_00039</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                      </VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                      <DEFAULT-VALUE>false</DEFAULT-VALUE>
                      <SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>false</SYMBOLIC-NAME-VALUE>
                    </ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF>
                    <ECUC-BOOLEAN-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:ae0b4b1d-cb56-40b3-8abd-9fde9278f135">
                      <SHORT-NAME>EthIfSetForwardingModeApi</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Enables /disables EthIf_SetForwardingMode API.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：EthIfSetForwardingModeApi 配置项用于启用或禁用以太网接口的转发模式设置API，允许上层软件根据需要动态地改变网络帧的转发行为。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，确保该API与网络管理和诊断需求兼容；如果不需要动态改变转发模式，可以不启用此API以节省资源；在配置时应考虑系统安全性，防止未授权的访问或修改网络行为。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <ADMIN-DATA>
                        <SDGS>
                          <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                            <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                          </SDG>
                        </SDGS>
                      </ADMIN-DATA>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_EthIf_00062</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>1</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <SCOPE>LOCAL</SCOPE>
                      <ORIGIN>AUTOSAR_ECUC</ORIGIN>
                      <POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>false</POST-BUILD-VARIANT-VALUE>
                      <VALUE-CONFIG-CLASSES>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-LINK-TIME</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-POST-BUILD</CONFIG-VARIANT>
                        </ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                        <ECUC-VALUE-CONFIGURATION-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-CLASS>PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-CLASS>
                          <CONFIG-VARIANT>VARIANT-PRE-COMPILE</CONFIG-VARIANT>
