                    <ECUC-FLOAT-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:dd71a3db-7a04-488a-baf1-59d144a893f1">
                      <SHORT-NAME>EthIfSignalQualityCheckPeriod</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Specifies the period in units of seconds in which the signal quality it polled in the context of EthIf_MainfunctionState. The value shall be an integral multiple of EthIfMainFunctionStatePeriod.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：EthIfSignalQualityCheckPeriod 配置项用于定义以太网接口模块（EthIf）检查网络信号质量的周期时间，通常以时间单位（如毫秒）表示。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该配置项的值应当根据网络的实际需求和性能指标来设置；过于频繁的检查可能会增加系统的开销，而检查周期过长可能导致信号质量问题不能及时被发现和处理；在设置此值时，还需考虑到硬件能力和系统中其他任务的调度策略。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <ADMIN-DATA>
                        <SDGS>
                          <SDG GID="VCOS:Display">
                            <SD GID="VCOS:BaseUnit">s</SD>
                          </SDG>
                          <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                            <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                          </SDG>
                        </SDGS>
                      </ADMIN-DATA>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_EthIf_00077</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
                      <LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>0</LOWER-MULTIPLICITY>
                      <UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>1</UPPER-MULTIPLICITY>
