                    <ECUC-FLOAT-PARAM-DEF UUID="ECUC:c3fdc046-2946-452a-b5ee-94de9eb4e3b9">
                      <SHORT-NAME>EthIfSwitchOffPortTimeDelay</SHORT-NAME>
                      <DESC>
                        <L-2 L="EN">Denote the time delay after the mode &quot;ETHTRCV_MODE_DOWN&quot; of a EthIfSwitchPortGroup will be executed.</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">概述：EthIfSwitchOffPortTimeDelay 配置项用于定义以太网接口在关闭端口后，延迟一定时间再进行物理层的断电，以确保所有在途数据包的处理。</L-2>
                        <L-2 L="ZH">注意：该延迟时间应根据网络的具体需求和性能指标来设置，以避免数据丢失；过长的延迟时间可能会影响系统的能耗效率；在AUTOSAR CP 4.4标准中，此配置项的具体数值需要根据实际硬件和网络环境来调整。</L-2>
                      </DESC>
                      <ADMIN-DATA>
                        <SDGS>
                          <SDG GID="VCOS:Display">
                            <SD GID="VCOS:BaseUnit">s</SD>
                          </SDG>
                        </SDGS>
                        <SDGS>
                          <SDG GID="VCOS:CfgUnrealized">
                            <SD GID="VCOS:CfgLock">true</SD>
                          </SDG>
                        </SDGS>
                      </ADMIN-DATA>
                      <INTRODUCTION>
                        <P>
                          <L-1 L="EN">This is only used for EthIfSwtPortGroups which are not referenced by any EthIfController.

                                        The time delay shall be greater than the UdpNm timings, because UdpNm shall finish its shutdown handling. (Repeat Message State, Prepare Bus-Sleep state, Bus-Sleep state).</L-1>
                        </P>
                      </INTRODUCTION>
                      <RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF BASE="ArTrace" DEST="TRACEABLE">ECUC_EthIf_00054</RELATED-TRACE-ITEM-REF>
